# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Git export attributes
# Files/directories marked export-ignore are excluded from the
# auto-generated .tar.gz / .zip archives GitHub produces for
# releases and the "Download ZIP" button.
#
# The full repository (including demo/ and vercel.json) is still:
#   • Cloned normally by Vercel for deployment
#   • Visible in the GitHub UI
#   • Available to contributors via git clone
#
# Only the downloadable release archives are affected.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Demo site — not part of the library distribution
demo/           export-ignore

# Vercel deployment config — infra file, not library-related
vercel.json     export-ignore

# Build tooling — users don't need this to use the library
vite.config.js  export-ignore
